flake-check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7363727Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7363970Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake-check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7364522Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
