flake-check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7365773Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake-check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7366296Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake-check (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7366512Z 
