conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7618137Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7618403Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7618889Z    can use Nix.
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7619188Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7619365Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7619715Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7620218Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7620873Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7621215Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7621541Z I will:
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7621767Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7622004Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7622929Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7623675Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7624198Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7624737Z  - install Nix in /nix
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7625145Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7625686Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7627442Z    /root
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7627898Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7628526Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7631426Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7632022Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.7633173Z 
