ffi-lifecycle-diagnostics (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.6959699Z 
ffi-lifecycle-diagnostics (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.6960117Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
