conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9477270Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9512920Z ^[[0m
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9513840Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9514470Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9514800Z 
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9515060Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9515560Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9515910Z 
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9516140Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9516780Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9517100Z 
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9517550Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [351..356])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 350)^[[0m
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9518200Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9518630Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9518950Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9519130Z 
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9519320Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9519620Z 
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9519910Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9520330Z    can use Nix.
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9520470Z 
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9520560Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9520710Z 
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9520970Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9521370Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
