conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9546040Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
conformance-offline (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.9546520Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
