outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1189720Z 
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1190101Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1190296Z 
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1191173Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1191716Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
