outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1195902Z I will:
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1196829Z 
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1197520Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1198505Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1199201Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1199997Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1201077Z  - install Nix in /nix
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1202406Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1203024Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1203439Z    /root
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1212023Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1212711Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1223185Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1224154Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:50.1224593Z 
