composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4560494Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4568561Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4655140Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4663064Z ^[[0m
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4664059Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4664640Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4664876Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4665244Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4666305Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4667047Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4667363Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4668069Z    if you are ready to continue.
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4668335Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4669140Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4670055Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4670549Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4670995Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4671185Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4671383Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4671686Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4671886Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4672394Z    can use Nix.
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4672561Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4672674Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4672902Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4677258Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4677996Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4683607Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4684286Z I will:
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4684626Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4684862Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4685337Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4685855Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4686658Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4687030Z  - install Nix in /nix
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4687419Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4687884Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4688344Z    /root
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4699912Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4700498Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4711335Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4711948Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4712231Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4716151Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4717066Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4731995Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4732798Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4740688Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4741301Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4741875Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4742132Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4742361Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4742616Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4742919Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4743512Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4743778Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4743897Z If you would like to
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4744253Z see the output, try like this:
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4744471Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4744683Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4745164Z   $ sh ./install-nix
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4745391Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4745399Z 
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4745731Z ^[[32m~~> Checking for artifacts of previous installs
composition (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:47.4751058Z ^[[0mBefore I try to install, I'll check for signs Nix already is or has
