gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2131952Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2132271Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2134486Z    if you are ready to continue.
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2135956Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2136476Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2137188Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2138244Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2138760Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2138973Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2139242Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2139584Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2139819Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2140331Z    can use Nix.
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2140565Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2140732Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2140981Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2141362Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2141937Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2142229Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2142430Z I will:
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2142879Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2143305Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2144068Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2144610Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2145147Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2145600Z  - install Nix in /nix
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2146016Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2146542Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2146994Z    /root
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2153917Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2154691Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2165081Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2165718Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2166092Z 
gopath-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:45.2169843Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
