outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3182670Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3209970Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3248800Z 
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3249910Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3250630Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3251250Z 
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3256800Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3258740Z    if you are ready to continue.
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3266050Z 
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3294970Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [351..356])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 350)^[[0m
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3295920Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3297350Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3323110Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3323720Z 
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3324600Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3326150Z 
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3327000Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3328160Z    can use Nix.
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3328790Z 
outside-the-sandbox (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:52.3329300Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
