flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1572496Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1581008Z ^[[0m
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1581462Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1581810Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1581984Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1582124Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1582594Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1582890Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1583081Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1583886Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1584086Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1584392Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
