flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1585604Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1585869Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1586019Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1586212Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1586393Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1586538Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1586823Z    can use Nix.
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1586943Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1587036Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1587167Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1587395Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1587713Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1591459Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1591625Z I will:
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1592084Z 
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1592344Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1592868Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
