flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1593638Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1593952Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1594260Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
