flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1595156Z    /root
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1606002Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1606553Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake-check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.1615286Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
