conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7668380Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7668690Z    can use Nix.
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7668780Z 
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7668860Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
