conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7696010Z I will:
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7696170Z 
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7696720Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7697340Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7698460Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
