conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7752860Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7754170Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
conformance-update (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:29:03.7754680Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
