gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1492040Z ^[[0m
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1493490Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1495270Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1496120Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1496840Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1497950Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1498530Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1499010Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1500160Z    if you are ready to continue.
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1500520Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1501780Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [351..356])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 350)^[[0m
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1503080Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1504060Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1504880Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1505600Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1505960Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1506740Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1507220Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1508110Z    can use Nix.
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1508390Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1508660Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1509190Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1510340Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1511310Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1549370Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1550240Z I will:
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1550610Z 
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1552360Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1554300Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1556260Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1556990Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1557400Z  - install Nix in /nix
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1557890Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1558430Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1560330Z    /var/root
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1590840Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
