gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1671950Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
gopath-native (macos-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:28:02.1676750Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
