supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.8985200Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9538310Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9589860Z ^[[0m
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9592690Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9594260Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9594630Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9594930Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9595510Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9595980Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9596420Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9596970Z    if you are ready to continue.
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9599790Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9601120Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [351..356])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 350)^[[0m
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9605190Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9605970Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9606470Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9606720Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9607010Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9607740Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9608910Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9610150Z    can use Nix.
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9611210Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9611680Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9614060Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9614600Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9615150Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9645000Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9646200Z I will:
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9649150Z 
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9651360Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9654390Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9658690Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9660590Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9660990Z  - install Nix in /nix
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9661350Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9661840Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9662290Z    /var/root
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9687510Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9690710Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9730980Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9732230Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9733510Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9735130Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
supported-go (macos-latest, 1-27)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:30:45.9735640Z 
