outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:43.9586442Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
outside-the-sandbox (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:43.9594538Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
