conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.8697573Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.8697961Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.8698869Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.8699439Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.8699804Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.8700947Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.8701607Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:44.8702275Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
