conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3024751Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3118631Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3128366Z ^[[0m
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3128905Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3129545Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3129819Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3130055Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3131337Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3132039Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3132403Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3132866Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3133309Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3133951Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3134737Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3135402Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3135920Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3136150Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3136412Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3136755Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3137011Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3137433Z    can use Nix.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3137742Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3137979Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3138295Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3138723Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3139300Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3139655Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3139817Z I will:
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3140081Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3140609Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3141263Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3141824Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3142257Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3142653Z  - install Nix in /nix
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3142998Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3143485Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3143984Z    /root
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3155839Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3156741Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3166085Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3166894Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T04:25:46.3167215Z 
